              "tweet_ids": [
                8,
                12
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "Provincial Urban Search and Rescue deployed to the Aldan House site on Cobbett Row later that morning.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                19,
                25
              ],
              "id": "2a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "Injuries were officially documented in Nerridge, and Nerridge Fire Service rescued people from Cobbett Row.",
