              "tweet_ids": [
                40,
                42
              ],
              "id": "2a.5"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 4 November 2025, Provincial Urban Search and Rescue successfully rescued individuals from the Aldan House collapse zone.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                61,
                62
              ],
              "id": "2a.6"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 8 November 2025, authorities confirmed fatalities resulting from the east wing collapse, while clarifying that the west wing did not collapse and the tower crane did not fall.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                110,
                113,
                120
              ],
              "id": "2a.7"
            },
            {
              "text": "Police deployed to Cobbett Row to secure the area amid dangerous conditions, confirming no looting took place, while relief assistance and transfers were completed.",
