              "tweet_ids": [
                114,
                117,
                127,
                128,
                131
              ],
              "id": "2a.8"
            },
            {
              "text": "Restoration of affected infrastructure and the tower crane was completed on Cobbett Row.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
